1
00:08:06,315 --> 00:08:12,315
Peterloo is a history, drama film directed by Mike Leigh.

2
00:16:12,631 --> 00:16:18,631
An epic portrayal of the events surrounding the infamous 1819 Peterloo Massacre, where a peaceful pro-democracy rally at St
Peter’s Field in Manchester turned into one of the bloodiest and most notorious episodes in British history.

3
00:24:18,947 --> 00:24:24,947
The massacre saw British government forces charge into a crowd of over 60,000 that had
gathered to demand political reforms and protest against rising levels of poverty.

4
00:32:25,263 --> 00:32:31,263
Henry Hunt, played by Rory Kinnear.

5
00:40:31,578 --> 00:40:37,578
Nellie, played by Maxine Peake.

6
00:48:37,894 --> 00:48:43,894
Joshua, played by Pearce Quigley.

7
00:56:44,210 --> 00:56:50,210
Joseph, played by David Moorst.

8
01:04:50,526 --> 01:04:56,526
Mary, played by Rachel Finnegan.

9
01:12:56,842 --> 01:13:02,842
Robert, played by Tom Meredith.

10
01:21:03,157 --> 01:21:09,157
Peterloo is a 2018 British historical drama film
written and directed by Mike Leigh.

11
01:29:09,473 --> 01:29:15,473
Based on the Peterloo Massacre of 1819, it stars  Rory
Kinnear, Maxine Peake, and Pearce Quigley.

12
01:37:15,789 --> 01:37:21,789
The film was selected to be screened in the main competition
section of the 75th Venice International Film Festival.

13
01:45:22,105 --> 01:45:28,105
The film received its UK premiere on 17 October 2018, as part of
the BFI London Film Festival, at HOME in Manchester.

14
01:53:28,421 --> 01:53:34,421
The screening marked the first time that the festival
had held a premiere outside London.

15
02:01:34,736 --> 02:01:40,736
Leigh said he was delighted that Peterloo would
be premiered "where it happened".

16
02:09:41,052 --> 02:09:47,052
It was released in the United Kingdom on 2 November 2018, by Entertainment One
and in the United States on 5 April 2019, by Amazon Studios.

17
02:17:47,368 --> 02:17:53,368
The film explores themes of based on true story, massacre,
period drama, british history, historical drama.

18
02:25:53,684 --> 02:25:59,684
The tone is emotional.
